Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:06.98,TL,,0,0,0,,温网第一轮 谢尔顿拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:08.94,TL,,0,0,0,,最后却输掉了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:09.94,TL,,0,0,0,,两个多月后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:13.16,TL,,0,0,0,,他第一次站上大满贯决赛的球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:15.41,TL,,0,0,0,,先从澳网说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:19.01,TL,,0,0,0,,打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强之后 他{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘输给辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:43.87,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月达拉斯 面对弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:46.49,TL,,0,0,0,,他在决胜盘救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:48.53,TL,,0,0,0,,最后逆转夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.35,0:01:16.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ben Shelton stands alone in the Lone Star State.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿在孤星之州独占鳌头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:20.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A new champion crowned in Dallas.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N达拉斯迎来新王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:23.61,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月慕尼黑 两盘击败科博利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.61,0:01:25.50,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季第二冠到手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:28.90,TL,,0,0,0,,这一回 他在红土上举起奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:42.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ben Shelton is the 2026 BMW Open{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿夺得{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年宝马公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:45.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}by Bitpanda champion here in Munich.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在慕尼黑加冕冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.32,0:01:48.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Runner-up twelve months ago.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十二个月前他还是亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:49.96,TL,,0,0,0,,可到了法网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.13,TL,,0,0,0,,他却在第二轮{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘输给科利尼翁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:56.84,TL,,0,0,0,,红土冠军 没有变成大满贯突破
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.29,0:02:00.94,TL,,0,0,0,,转上草地 斯图加特决赛又遇弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:02.09,TL,,0,0,0,,他{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:04.92,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到生涯第一座草地冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:06.68,TL,,0,0,0,,半个月后的温网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.41,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘最后的抢十
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.41,0:02:09.97,TL,,0,0,0,,他曾以{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.97,0:02:11.24,TL,,0,0,0,,还拿到一个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:13.67,TL,,0,0,0,,最终却在第一轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:16.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月 加拿大大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.52,TL,,0,0,0,,他{\fs78}6{\fs68}场比赛一盘未失
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:22.14,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘击败中岛布兰登 成功卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:42.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ben Shelton delivers a masterful performance in Montreal,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿在蒙特利尔打出大师级表现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:45.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that will yield the most glittering of prizes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赢得最耀眼的奖赏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:53.94,TL,,0,0,0,,美网 他第一次击败阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:55.18,TL,,0,0,0,,又逆转蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:57.73,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次打进大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:02:59.70,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:02.24,TL,,0,0,0,,他{\fs78}4{\fs68}盘落败 收获亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:04.50,TL,,0,0,0,,从温网首轮到纽约决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:07.39,TL,,0,0,0,,他走出了完全不同的一段路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.35,0:03:16.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match, Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 兹维列夫获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:20.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Umpire announces the score]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【裁判宣布比分】
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Zverev doesn't know he's won.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫还不知道自己赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.75,0:03:24.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He doesn't even know he's won.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他甚至没意识到自己赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.21,0:03:27.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There you go.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这下知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:33.62,TL,,0,0,0,,亚洲赛季 上海止步第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:34.65,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:37.94,TL,,0,0,0,,另一场比赛替他锁定了年终席位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:39.70,TL,,0,0,0,,达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:42.23,TL,,0,0,0,,在上海决赛击败霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:45.82,TL,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿连续第二年 拿到都灵门票
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:49.58,TL,,0,0,0,,资格到手以后 巴塞尔止步第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:52.54,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎先胜诺里 再逆转林德克内希
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:54.22,TL,,0,0,0,,打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:56.11,TL,,0,0,0,,截至{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}6{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:57.94,TL,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿{\fs78}4720{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:04:00.10,TL,,0,0,0,,排名赛季积分榜第四
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.54,TL,,0,0,0,,高亮的{\fs78}6{\fs68}位球员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:03.81,TL,,0,0,0,,都已锁定年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:07.59,TL,,0,0,0,,错过温网赛点 后来站上美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:08.98,TL,,0,0,0,,第二次到都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:11.79,TL,,0,0,0,,你看好谢尔顿冲进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强吗？
